    "turn_text": "Building a website used to mean hiring a pricey designer or learning to code. Not anymore. With Framer, you can design stunning, interactive websites. No coding needed. Just drag, drop, and publish like a pro. Framer is the design first no-code website builder that lets anyone ship a production ready site in minutes. It's free to get started, and you can browse over 700 pixel perfect templates or designed from a totally blank canvas. Real-time collaboration means your writer, designer, and marketer can all tweak the same page at once. Built-in AI, it handles the heavy lifting, generates starter layouts, auto-translate your entire site to any language, and even suggest on-brand color palettes. Behind the scenes, you get a fast, mobile-friendly site with secure hosting, built-in SEO, easy content editing, and privacy-friendly analytics. Ready to build a site that looks hand-coded without hiring a developer? Start free today at Framer.com and use promo code KIM. Go to Framer.com and use promo code KIM to start building a site for free. Hey, it's Kim Commando today. It's your fun podcast about all things digital. And don't forget to like, comment, share because, you know, here's the deal. There's big tech and then there are big tech algorithms. And the big tech algorithm say that if somebody likes, comment, shares and follows and does all that great stuff is that it's good content and more people want to see that. So then we get to go to the front page at youtube.com.",
