    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/3/83801.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 274,
    "turn_text": "In some ways, the meetings are the problem because one of the things that's happened is you have these things called schedulers, which their job in life is to make your life miserable. And they schedule every 15 minutes and you go to another meeting, another meeting, another meeting, another meeting. And it's often people that have legitimate issues with government, or they want something, most of them want money, or want you to regulate their competition.",
